    narr:narration """This hub tracks the strategic positioning of a product defined explicitly as a [structured async decision platform](narr:Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform), a category constructed in direct opposition to [real-time chat tools](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat). The initial vision, established in March 2026, targeted [remote teams of 10-50 people](narr:Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams) with a [base pricing model of $12/user/month](narr:Position_PricingTwelveDollars). 

By August 2026, the narrative focus shifted toward validating this positioning through recent delivery milestones. Team performance data from August highlights the [shipment of an async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_1) and a [record velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_2), with the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_3) cited as the primary driver for these outcomes. The trajectory moves from the abstract definition of a market anti-pattern toward concrete evidence of operational success within that specific product niche.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_PricingTwelveDollars> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_Sprint4OutcomeAttribution> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Structured async decision platform" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Real-time chat (Slack, Teams) is the named anti-pattern." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We shipped the async decision widget." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Velocity was 23 points, highest this quarter." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The Zephyr integration was the key unlock." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787131870845_3> ] ;
